{"type":"message","id":"cf7912e6","parentId":"273c7d1d","timestamp":"2026-04-14T22:00:27.791Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! Weather data received. Now I need to check for system status and memory files.\n\nLooking at the workspace structure, I should check:\n1. HEARTBEAT.md for system status protocol\n2. Today's memory file (memory/2026-04-15.md)\n3. SESSION-STATE.md if it exists for any blockers\n4. heartbeat-state.json for state tracking\n\nLet me read these files to gather the briefing information.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9d139526a5d841a48e294524","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-04-15.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_59bc739872904d61b92a728f","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3cd17e1383ee4f87aee530a6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/SESSION-STATE.md 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":35,"output":260,"cacheRead":20281,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20576,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776204024438,"responseId":"20260415060027b085ea58f8cf4632"}}
{"type":"message","id":"c2eb6305","parentId":"cf7912e6","timestamp":"2026-04-14T22:00:27.834Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9d139526a5d841a48e294524","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-04-15 (수)\n\n## Cron Health\n- **CRITICAL:** daily-github-backup push failed (403 error)\n  - Local commit successful (46 files changed, 828 insertions, 1570 deletions)\n  - Commit ID: 7b5be2f1\n  - Error: Permission denied to NousResearch/hermes-agent.git for Lfantasial\n  - **Root cause:** Lfantasial 계정이 NousResearch/hermes-agent.git에 대한 쓰기 권한이 없음\n  - **해결 방안:** GitHub 개인용 액세스 토큰 갱신 또는 Lfantasial의 포크 저장소로 원격 변경 필요\n\n## System Status\n- Gateway restart ok (npm)\n- **OpenClaw:** Update available (npm 2026.4.14, current: pnpm stable)\n- **Skills:** All up to date\n\n## Heartbeat Notes\n- Day rollover to 2026-04-15\n- GitHub backup push failure at 04:00 KST (local commit 성공, 리모트 푸시 실패)\n- Security audit completed at 03:00 KST\n- OpenClaw update check completed at 06:00 KST: 업데이트 없음 (2026.4.14 최신, 스킬 업데이트)\n- Morning briefing delivered at 07:01 KST\n- Notion briefing delivered at 08:00 KST (0 new items)\n- GitHub briefing delivered at 09:02 KST\n- Update check completed at 06:29 KST: OpenClaw 업데이트 없음, 스킬 최신 상태\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776204027830}}
